{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/graphics/bloom/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2>Kernel</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 610px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/141fe9f34ae9d3cba42e559ee7ca1527/5d5ad/kn.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 180.72916666666666%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/141fe9f34ae9d3cba42e559ee7ca1527/a59e9/kn.webp 192w,\n/static/141fe9f34ae9d3cba42e559ee7ca1527/0ca9f/kn.webp 384w,\n/static/141fe9f34ae9d3cba42e559ee7ca1527/2e913/kn.webp 610w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 610px) 100vw, 610px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/141fe9f34ae9d3cba42e559ee7ca1527/3b721/kn.png 192w,\n/static/141fe9f34ae9d3cba42e559ee7ca1527/66595/kn.png 384w,\n/static/141fe9f34ae9d3cba42e559ee7ca1527/5d5ad/kn.png 610w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 610px) 100vw, 610px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/141fe9f34ae9d3cba42e559ee7ca1527/5d5ad/kn.png\"\n            alt=\"Kernel\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>이미지에 특정한 행렬 연산을 함으로써, 흐려짐, 선명해짐, 엠보싱, 에지 감지 등의 특수한 효과를 줄 수 있다.</li>\n<li>이미지를 행렬로 표현하고, 위의 커널을 참고하여 합성 행렬 간의 합성곱 연산을 하면 효과가 적용된다.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Convolution</h2>\n<p><img src=\"/85bbc15c2a0290011f5d2b73cd8d8e00/cv.gif\" alt=\"Convolution\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>합성곱이란 위 이미지처럼 각 요소에 해당하는 요소들을 곱 연산 후 더해준다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 723px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/78786ce2dfa6dd1d0c80c9311d334108/d949d/cv2.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 19.270833333333332%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/78786ce2dfa6dd1d0c80c9311d334108/a59e9/cv2.webp 192w,\n/static/78786ce2dfa6dd1d0c80c9311d334108/0ca9f/cv2.webp 384w,\n/static/78786ce2dfa6dd1d0c80c9311d334108/d196b/cv2.webp 723w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 723px) 100vw, 723px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/78786ce2dfa6dd1d0c80c9311d334108/3b721/cv2.png 192w,\n/static/78786ce2dfa6dd1d0c80c9311d334108/66595/cv2.png 384w,\n/static/78786ce2dfa6dd1d0c80c9311d334108/d949d/cv2.png 723w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 723px) 100vw, 723px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/78786ce2dfa6dd1d0c80c9311d334108/d949d/cv2.png\"\n            alt=\"Convolution\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>평균값 필터 (Mean Filter)</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 534px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/5e5c6f892dfb1a26971777e8960f383e/99f1d/2.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 60.9375%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/5e5c6f892dfb1a26971777e8960f383e/a59e9/2.webp 192w,\n/static/5e5c6f892dfb1a26971777e8960f383e/0ca9f/2.webp 384w,\n/static/5e5c6f892dfb1a26971777e8960f383e/c7900/2.webp 534w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/5e5c6f892dfb1a26971777e8960f383e/150b2/2.jpg 192w,\n/static/5e5c6f892dfb1a26971777e8960f383e/6985d/2.jpg 384w,\n/static/5e5c6f892dfb1a26971777e8960f383e/99f1d/2.jpg 534w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/5e5c6f892dfb1a26971777e8960f383e/99f1d/2.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Mean Filter\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>단순히 주변 픽셀에 대해 동일한 가중치로 합성곱 연산을 수행하는 방법이다.</li>\n<li>픽셀 값의 변화가 줄어들고, 날카로운 에지가 무뎌지며, 노이즈의 영향이 크게 사라지는 효과가 있다.</li>\n<li>마스크의 크기가 크면 클 수록 부드러운 느낌이 강해지나, 연산량이 크게 증가할 수 있다.\n<ul>\n<li>3 x 3 크기의 필터 마스크는 9개 요소로, 모든 원소가 1/9로 설정된 행렬이이다.</li>\n<li>5 x 5 크기의 필터 마스크는 25개 요소로, 모든 원소가 1/25로 설정된 행렬이이다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Code</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"cpp\"><pre class=\"language-cpp\"><code class=\"language-cpp\"><span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> j <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> j <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> height<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> j<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> i <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> i <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> width<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> i<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        Vector3 resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> si<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n            Vector3 neighborColor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">GetPixel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">//</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> j <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> j <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> height<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> j<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> i <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> i <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> width<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> i<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        Vector3 resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> si<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n            Vector3 neighborColor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">GetPixel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>i<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> j <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>Result</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/5fbd7/mbr.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/a59e9/mbr.webp 192w,\n/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/0ca9f/mbr.webp 384w,\n/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/dc9b9/mbr.webp 768w,\n/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/e2c2f/mbr.webp 1152w,\n/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/7974c/mbr.webp 1276w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/3b721/mbr.png 192w,\n/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/66595/mbr.png 384w,\n/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/fe486/mbr.png 768w,\n/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/d2d74/mbr.png 1152w,\n/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/5fbd7/mbr.png 1276w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/b80cf3e6c1e31bff9cf082bc9f917f64/fe486/mbr.png\"\n            alt=\"Mean Filter\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>가우시안 필터 (Gaussian Filter)</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/9c259/gb.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 57.29166666666667%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/a59e9/gb.webp 192w,\n/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/0ca9f/gb.webp 384w,\n/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/dc9b9/gb.webp 768w,\n/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/e2c2f/gb.webp 1152w,\n/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/fcda8/gb.webp 1272w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/3b721/gb.png 192w,\n/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/66595/gb.png 384w,\n/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/fe486/gb.png 768w,\n/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/d2d74/gb.png 1152w,\n/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/9c259/gb.png 1272w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/379666c4f9f3628a2de4723de577426c/fe486/gb.png\"\n            alt=\"Gaussian Filter\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>평균값 필터는 대상에 가까이 있는 픽셀과 멀리 있는 픽셀이 모두 같은 가중치를 사용하고 있다.</li>\n<li>멀리 있는 픽셀은 멀리 있음에도 불구하고 많은 영향을 끼치게 된다.</li>\n<li>가우시안 필터는 가중치를 통해 멀리 있는 픽셀의 영향을 낮춘다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/98ef1/gbm.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 48.4375%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/a59e9/gbm.webp 192w,\n/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/0ca9f/gbm.webp 384w,\n/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/dc9b9/gbm.webp 768w,\n/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/e2c2f/gbm.webp 1152w,\n/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/2e958/gbm.webp 1226w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/3b721/gbm.png 192w,\n/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/66595/gbm.png 384w,\n/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/fe486/gbm.png 768w,\n/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/d2d74/gbm.png 1152w,\n/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/98ef1/gbm.png 1226w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/8c7a93bccfa9f52c5f7e8ddb4754c744/fe486/gbm.png\"\n            alt=\"Gaussian Filter\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3>Code</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"cpp\"><pre class=\"language-cpp\"><code class=\"language-cpp\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">float</span> weights<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0545f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2442f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.4026f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2442f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0545f</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> j <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> j <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> height<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> j<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> i <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> i <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> width<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> i<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        Vector3 resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> si<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n            Vec4 neighborColor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token operator\">-></span><span class=\"token function\">GetPixel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> weights<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>si<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> weights<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>si<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> weights<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>si<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> j <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> j <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> height<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> j<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> i <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> i <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> width<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> i<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        Vector3 resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.0f</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> si<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n            Vec4 neighborColor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token operator\">-></span><span class=\"token function\">GetPixel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>i<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> j <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> si <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> weights<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>si<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> weights<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>si<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n            resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> neighborColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> weights<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>si<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>r<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>g<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        pixels<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> width <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> j<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> resultColor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>b<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>Result</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 640px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/e71642bbdc13a3a89d45db49be0e02dd/0f09e/gbr.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/e71642bbdc1